              "tooltipText": "",
              "value": "Charts can be created from a variety of data sources including APIs, database connections, and CSV files. This chart builder can help you configure a chart without requiring any code.\n\nConsider using our Mock Data Generator to create a custom dataset for the purpose of configuring your chart, then copy the code below into your own application and simply connect your resource. To get started, generate an API in the link provided and copy the GET endpoint using the button provided into the 'Data API URL' space below.\n\nhttps://retool.com/utilities/data-generator\n\nNot sure what your data will look like? click 'Use Sample Data' to import some prepared data instead.",
